      "bullets": {
        "_note": "要点页：标题骨架来自 content_page；主体为单栏要点区，项目符号自绘圆点（accent 色，白底 5.02:1 达标），悬挂缩进 0.32；source 为数据来源行（optional，small 14pt，与页码同行、位于页脚带）。**max_lines=8 是按容量反算的上限**（③a 口径统一后按 WPS 实测单倍行高 1.228 重算）：8 行 × (20pt÷72×1.228×1.35 = 0.4605 in) + 7 段 × (10pt = 0.1389 in) = 4.656 ≤ box.h 4.85；9 行 = 5.255 放不下（②a 独立复核曾按旧口径定 9 行，②b 出图实测行高后修正）。缩到下限 18pt 时同框可容 9 行；超上限由渲染器告警并建议拆页。",
        "inherits": "content_page",
        "background": "surface",
        "elements": [
          {
            "role": "body",
            "box": { "x": 0.8, "y": 1.8, "w": 11.7333, "h": 4.85 },
            "text": { "size": "body", "color": "text_on_light", "align": "left", "valign": "top", "line_spacing": 1.35 },
            "bullet": { "char": "•", "indent_in": 0.32, "hanging_in": 0.32, "gap_after_pt": 10, "gap_between_only": true, "color": "accent" },
            "autofit": { "min_size_pt": 18, "max_lines": 8 }
          },
          {
            "role": "source",
            "box": { "x": 0.8, "y": 6.95, "w": 10.0, "h": 0.33 },
